                  <fr:mainmatter>
                    <html:p>We use Forester as a reference manager and it captures all of the
right metadata about a document. I'd also like if it made it easier to
access the PDF of a reference. We should track where the pdf is stored
locally and include a button that opens the pdf viewer chosen by the
user.</html:p>
                    <html:p>Further, we may wish for there to be a element in the tree
that renders the pdf in the browser.</html:p>
                  </fr:mainmatter>
