                    <fr:title text="Manage Grocery lists">Manage Grocery lists</fr:title>
                    <fr:taxon>TODO</fr:taxon>
                    <fr:meta name="status">done</fr:meta>
                    <fr:meta name="completed">2026-02-21</fr:meta>
                  </fr:frontmatter>
                  <fr:mainmatter>
                    <html:p>Hook into the groceries list on my apple reminders for two
directional grocery list sync.</html:p>
                    <html:p>Implemented in <html:code>forester-org.el</html:code> with bidirectional Apple Reminders sync:</html:p>
                    <html:ul><html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-add</html:code> — quick-add an item (creates tree + pushes to Apple)</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-add-multi</html:code> — add multiple items at once (comma or newline separated)</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-list</html:code> — view pending items in a query buffer</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-pull</html:code> — pull items added via Siri/phone into forester</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-push</html:code> — push local items to Apple Reminders</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-clear-done</html:code> — sync completion status from Apple</html:li>
<html:li><html:code>forester-grocery-sync</html:code> — full bidirectional sync (pull + push + clear done)</html:li></html:ul>
                    <html:p>Uses a configurable Apple Reminders list (default "Groceries") via
<html:code>forester-org-grocery-list</html:code>. Items added via Siri to the Groceries list
are automatically pulled into forester as trees with <![CDATA[\tag{grocery}]]>.</html:p>
                  </fr:mainmatter>
                </fr:tree>
